    "overview": "Near-black blue working surfaces, icy cyan actions and fine vector rules translate the user-pinned NEXUS telemetry direction into a compact local video tool. Pale text and restrained semantic color support precise inspection without competing with the media.\n\nThe visual language is operational: measured time, completed-stage counts and connected phase markers describe real work. Native bilingual controls and visible recovery preserve a professional, simple interface. No reference artwork or external font asset is shipped.",
